dataset.py: dataset classes for the whole project (FrameDataset, MILVideoDataset(Cluster), KaggleDRDataset)

match_clips.py: match frames (FRAME_DIRS) to clips (CLIP_DIRS) -> matching_results_{year}.json
match_grades.py: matching results + DR_Grading_Summary_v3.csv -> clip_labels_{year}.json, image_labels_{year}.json
match_grades_2020.py: Paxos2020 grades straight from annotations.csv (no still frames -> empty image lists)
find_frames.py: CPU-only frame matching, shardable (--num_shards/--shard_index, --skip_first)
split_data.py: stratified (5 grades) video-wise 80/20 splits, frame split follows the videos (~80/20)
  stratified_splits/ = fused 2025+2020, stratified_splits_paxos2025/ = 2025 (+ mil_*_2025.json, mil_train_mixed.json);
  the 2025 val videos and frame jsons are identical in both.
mix_paxos2020.ipynb: hand-pick grade-balanced Paxos2020 videos into a split's train set -> mil_train_mixed.json
  (+ mil_train_mixed_decisions.json for resuming); train with --fused_dataset.
multi_eval_paxos2025_*: vis_video_results.py prediction CSVs + analyse_runs.py results (all = old, baselines = 5-split
  comparison 2026-10-21, clfcos = same with the cosine+CDW classifiers 2026-10-22).

